value-ip plugin

This plugin comes from the `value-ip` plugin, version 1.3.1, in a private
repository of ai-advanced-futures (plugins/value-ip/). Luis F. Amadeo wrote it.
It is under the MIT license. This plugin ports it, with changes.

The four frameworks behind the plugin are the work of their authors: Hamilton
Helmer (7 Powers), W. Chan Kim and Renee Mauborgne (Blue Ocean ERRC), Clayton
Christensen (disruption theory), and Geoffrey Moore (Core and Context). The
plugin names them and does not copy their books.

